  "Send us a message and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.": "Skicka ett meddelande s\xE5 \xE5terkommer vi inom 24 timmar.",
  "Search help articles...": "S\xF6k i hj\xE4lpartiklar...",
  "Describe your issue...": "Beskriv ditt problem...",
  "Cookie Consent": "Cookie-samtycke",
  "Privacy Policy": "Integritetspolicy",
  "Necessary": "N\xF6dv\xE4ndiga",
  "Analytics": "Analys",
  "Marketing": "Marknadsf\xF6ring",
  "Cookie consent": "Cookie-samtycke",
  "Close cookie consent": "St\xE4ng cookie-samtycke",
  "Cookie settings": "Cookie-inst\xE4llningar",
  "Last updated: August 28, 2026": "Senast uppdaterad: 28 augusti 2026",
  "Terms of Service": "Anv\xE4ndarvillkor",
  "This page describes the main categories of information Tayar Intelligence may process when you use the product. The exact data involved depends on the features you choose to use.": "Den h\xE4r sidan beskriver huvudkategorierna av information som Tayar Intelligence kan behandla n\xE4r du anv\xE4nder produkten. Exakta data beror p\xE5 vilka funktioner du anv\xE4nder.",
  "Account details, profile settings, projects, files, preferences and collaboration data may be stored so the service can authenticate you, save your work and enforce access permissions.": "Kontouppgifter, profilinst\xE4llningar, projekt, filer, preferenser och samarbetsdata kan lagras f\xF6r autentisering, sparande av arbete och \xE5tkomstkontroll.",
  "Website Builder projects can include pages, media references, form submissions, leads, analytics events, release history, publishing settings and team permissions. Public website forms and analytics use dedicated server-side controls and rate limits.": "Projekt i Webbplatsbyggaren kan inneh\xE5lla sidor, mediereferenser, formul\xE4rsvar, leads, analysh\xE4ndelser, versionshistorik, publiceringsinst\xE4llningar och teambeh\xF6righeter. Publika formul\xE4r och analys anv\xE4nder s\xE4rskilda serverkontroller och hastighetsgr\xE4nser.",
  "The application uses third-party infrastructure such as Supabase for authentication, database and storage capabilities. Features that use external AI or payment services may send the information required to complete that specific request to the configured provider.": "Applikationen anv\xE4nder tredjepartsinfrastruktur som Supabase f\xF6r autentisering, databas och lagring. Funktioner som anv\xE4nder externa AI- eller betaltj\xE4nster kan skicka den information som kr\xE4vs f\xF6r den specifika beg\xE4ran till konfigurerad leverant\xF6r.",
  "The application uses encrypted network connections and database access controls, including Row Level Security for user and workspace data. Authentication credentials are handled through the authentication provider rather than being stored as plaintext application data.": "Applikationen anv\xE4nder krypterade n\xE4tverksanslutningar och databas\xE5tkomstkontroller, inklusive Row Level Security f\xF6r anv\xE4ndar- och arbetsytedata. Autentiseringsuppgifter hanteras av autentiseringsleverant\xF6ren och lagras inte som klartext i appen.",
  "Browser storage may be used for authentication sessions, interface preferences, recovery data and consent choices. Analytics or production integrations are controlled by the relevant product and website settings.": "Webbl\xE4sarlagring kan anv\xE4ndas f\xF6r autentiseringssessioner, gr\xE4nssnittsinst\xE4llningar, \xE5terst\xE4llningsdata och samtyckesval. Analys- och produktionsintegrationer styrs av relevanta produkt- och webbplatsinst\xE4llningar.",
  "You can manage account preferences and many stored project settings inside the product. Requests relating to access, correction or deletion of personal data should be made through the support options available in your account.": "Du kan hantera kontoinst\xE4llningar och m\xE5nga lagrade projektinst\xE4llningar i produkten. Beg\xE4ran om \xE5tkomst, r\xE4ttelse eller radering av personuppgifter ska g\xF6ras via supportalternativen i ditt konto.",
  "This policy may be updated as the product, infrastructure or legal requirements change. The date at the top of this page shows the latest published revision.": "Policyn kan uppdateras n\xE4r produkten, infrastrukturen eller juridiska krav f\xF6r\xE4ndras. Datumet h\xF6gst upp visar senaste publicerade revision.",
  "By using Tayar Intelligence, you agree to use the service lawfully and in a way that does not interfere with other users, the platform or its infrastructure.": "Genom att anv\xE4nda Tayar Intelligence godk\xE4nner du att anv\xE4nda tj\xE4nsten lagligt och utan att st\xF6ra andra anv\xE4ndare, plattformen eller infrastrukturen.",
  "You are responsible for the accuracy of information submitted through your account and for keeping access to your account secure. Team and shared-project permissions should only be granted to people you intend to collaborate with.": "Du ansvarar f\xF6r riktigheten i information som skickas via ditt konto och f\xF6r att h\xE5lla kontot s\xE4kert. Team- och projektbeh\xF6righeter ska bara ges till personer du avser att samarbeta med.",
  "You remain responsible for reviewing the content, websites, documents and other outputs you create or publish through the platform. Automated or AI-assisted output should be checked before it is relied on or published.": "Du ansvarar fortsatt f\xF6r att granska inneh\xE5ll, webbplatser, dokument och andra resultat som du skapar eller publicerar via plattformen. Automatiskt eller AI-assisterat material ska kontrolleras innan det anv\xE4nds eller publiceras.",
  "You may not use the service to break the law, abuse public forms or APIs, bypass product limits or access controls, distribute malicious content, interfere with the service, or attempt unauthorized access to other accounts or projects.": "Du f\xE5r inte anv\xE4nda tj\xE4nsten f\xF6r att bryta mot lagen, missbruka publika formul\xE4r eller API:er, kringg\xE5 produktgr\xE4nser eller \xE5tkomstkontroller, sprida skadligt inneh\xE5ll, st\xF6ra tj\xE4nsten eller f\xF6rs\xF6ka f\xE5 obeh\xF6rig \xE5tkomst till andra konton eller projekt.",
  "Free, Pro and Business features and usage limits are displayed in the product. Paid pricing, renewal details, cancellation options and any applicable billing terms are presented through the configured checkout and billing portal. Applicable consumer rights remain unaffected.": "Funktioner och anv\xE4ndningsgr\xE4nser f\xF6r Free, Pro och Business visas i produkten. Betald priss\xE4ttning, f\xF6rnyelse, upps\xE4gning och till\xE4mpliga faktureringsvillkor visas via konfigurerad checkout och faktureringsportal. Till\xE4mpliga konsumentr\xE4ttigheter p\xE5verkas inte.",
  "Features may evolve as the product is improved. We may change, add or retire features when needed for security, reliability or product development. Important changes should be reflected in the product or these terms.": "Funktioner kan utvecklas n\xE4r produkten f\xF6rb\xE4ttras. Vi kan \xE4ndra, l\xE4gga till eller ta bort funktioner n\xE4r det beh\xF6vs f\xF6r s\xE4kerhet, tillf\xF6rlitlighet eller produktutveckling. Viktiga \xE4ndringar ska \xE5terspeglas i produkten eller villkoren.",
  "The service is provided as a productivity platform. You are responsible for the final decisions, publications and actions taken using the outputs of the service, including websites published to third-party or configured hosting destinations.": "Tj\xE4nsten tillhandah\xE5lls som en produktivitetsplattform. Du ansvarar f\xF6r slutliga beslut, publiceringar och \xE5tg\xE4rder som g\xF6rs med tj\xE4nstens resultat, inklusive webbplatser som publiceras till tredje part eller konfigurerade hostingm\xE5l.",
  "Questions about these terms can be submitted through the support options available in the product.": "Fr\xE5gor om villkoren kan skickas via supportalternativen i produkten.",
