  "Paid prices are controlled by STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID and STRIPE_BUSINESS_PRICE_ID, so the app never trusts a browser-supplied amount.": "Betalda priser styrs av STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID och STRIPE_BUSINESS_PRICE_ID, s\xE5 appen litar aldrig p\xE5 ett belopp som skickas fr\xE5n webbl\xE4saren.",
