  "Only the project owner can rollback a published release.": "Endast projekt\xE4garen kan \xE5terst\xE4lla en publicerad version.",
  "This release snapshot does not belong to the active project.": "Den h\xE4r versions\xF6gonblicksbilden tillh\xF6r inte det aktiva projektet.",
  "Only the project owner can delete release archives.": "Endast projekt\xE4garen kan ta bort versionsarkiv.",
  "You cannot delete the release currently serving as the live rollback reference.": "Du kan inte ta bort versionen som just nu anv\xE4nds som \xE5terst\xE4llningsreferens f\xF6r den live-publicerade versionen.",
  "Opening your saved website. Save will continue when it is loaded.": "Din sparade webbplats \xF6ppnas. Sparandet forts\xE4tter n\xE4r den har l\xE4sts in.",
  "Your existing website is still reconnecting. Tayar will not create a duplicate draft while its saved identity is available.": "Din befintliga webbplats \xE5teransluter fortfarande. Tayar skapar inte ett dubblettutkast s\xE5 l\xE4nge den sparade identiteten finns tillg\xE4nglig.",
  "Opening your most recent saved website before saving. No duplicate draft was created.": "Den senast sparade webbplatsen \xF6ppnas f\xF6re sparning. Inget dubblettutkast skapades.",
  "This shared project is read-only for your Viewer role.": "Det h\xE4r delade projektet \xE4r skrivskyddat f\xF6r din Viewer-roll.",
  "Local recovery storage is full. Cloud save will still be attempted.": "Det lokala \xE5terst\xE4llningslagret \xE4r fullt. Molnsparning kommer fortfarande att f\xF6rs\xF6ka k\xF6ras.",
  "You are offline. Changes are saved locally and will retry when the connection returns.": "Du \xE4r offline. \xC4ndringar sparas lokalt och f\xF6rs\xF6ks igen n\xE4r anslutningen \xE5terkommer.",
  "This history snapshot does not belong to the active project.": "Den h\xE4r historik\xF6gonblicksbilden tillh\xF6r inte det aktiva projektet.",
