  "Example: Make this fit a dark SaaS dashboard, use our existing buttons, reduce motion on mobile, and keep it accessible.": "Exempel: Anpassa detta till en m\xF6rk SaaS-dashboard, anv\xE4nd v\xE5ra befintliga knappar, minska r\xF6relse p\xE5 mobil och beh\xE5ll tillg\xE4ngligheten.",
